      "title": "⓪ 缺模型？/ Missing models?",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n全新安裝沒有模型檔，這支「參考圖生影片」範本需要以下 5 個檔案：\n\n- `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/` → 19.53 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- `qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` → 14.61 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/sakamakismile/Qwen3-VL-32B-Heretic-MiniMax-H3-NVFP4/resolve/main/qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/vae/` → 4.85 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/vae/` → 0.56 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/loras/` → 0.91 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/drbaph/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora-ComfyUI/resolve/main/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/loras/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors\n\n共約 40.5 GB。放好檔案後**不用重啟 ComfyUI 或 worker**：ComfyFed agent 每 10 分鐘自動重掃模型庫存並回報平台，評估會自動轉綠；急著馬上生效的話，手動重啟 agent 即可。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nA fresh install has none of these files. The “Reference to video” template needs 5 files:\n\n- `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/` -> 19.53 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- `qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` -> 14.61 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/sakamakismile/Qwen3-VL-32B-Heretic-MiniMax-H3-NVFP4/resolve/main/qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_heretic_minimax_h3_nvfp4.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/vae/` -> 4.85 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/vae/` -> 0.56 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n- `minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/loras/` -> 0.91 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/drbaph/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora-ComfyUI/resolve/main/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors\n  備份載點：https://storage.googleapis.com/comfyfed-models/models/loras/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_resized_avg_rank_64_bf16.safetensors\n\n~40.5 GB total. No restart needed after placing the files: the ComfyFed agent rescans its model inventory every 10 minutes and reports back, and the assessment turns green automatically once it does. Restart the agent if you want it to take effect immediately."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
