      "title": "① 用途＋紅框 / Purpose + red-framed nodes",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 只改這一區**\n\n給一張「開頭長怎樣」的圖、一張「結尾長怎樣」的圖，H3 會自己生出中間的動作，\n而且畫面自帶聲音。\n\n三個紅框節點：\n\n- `LoadImage`「首幀」— 影片開始那一格的樣子。\n- `LoadImage`「尾幀」— 影片結束那一格的樣子（兩張圖建議同一個人／同一個場景，\n  差異越合理，動作補得越自然）。\n- 提示詞（`PrimitiveStringMultiline`）— 用 `<Picture 1>` 指涉首幀圖，\n  然後**用一句話描述首尾之間發生了什麼動作**（例如「他把長矛從直立慢慢放平」）。\n  結尾可以加一行 `Audio: …` 描述想要的環境音。\n\n其他節點不用動。\n\n---\n\n**English — the only group you need to edit**\n\nGive one image for how the video starts and one for how it ends; H3 generates\nthe motion in between, with audio included. Three red-framed nodes: the\n\"first frame\" `LoadImage`, the \"last frame\" `LoadImage` (same subject/scene\nworks best), and the prompt, which must refer to the first frame as\n`<Picture 1>` and describe, in one sentence, the action that happens between\nthe two frames. An `Audio: …` line at the end sets the soundtrack."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
