      "title": "② 這在做什麼 / What this does",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n`MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` 用首幀圖當身分參考、也當影片的第一格；\n它輸出的 `positive`（提示詞條件）和 `LATENT`（影片畫布）先送進\n`MiniMaxH3AddGuide`，這顆節點把「尾幀」圖錨定在 `frame_idx = -1`\n（負數＝從影片結尾算，`-1` 就是最後一格），輸出更新過的 `positive`\n再接到 `BasicGuider`。\n\n換句話說：`MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` 定頭，`MiniMaxH3AddGuide` 定尾，\n兩者中間的畫面由模型自己補上，這就是「首尾幀生影片」的核心機制。\n\n後面的取樣參數（`steps=8`、`res_multistep`＋`simple`）跟參考圖生影片範本\n完全一樣，是配合 turbo LoRA 的固定搭配，新手不用動。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\n`MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` uses the first-frame image as both the identity\nreference and frame 0 of the video. Its `positive` conditioning and `LATENT`\ncanvas feed into `MiniMaxH3AddGuide`, which anchors the last-frame image at\n`frame_idx = -1` (negative indices count from the end, so -1 is the final\nframe) and outputs an updated `positive` that then goes to `BasicGuider`.\nEverything in between the two anchors is generated by the model — that is\nthe whole first/last-frame mechanism. The sampler settings are identical to\nthe reference-to-video template's turbo-LoRA pairing; leave them alone."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
